		(property "BOM Comments" "Same CSD17483F4 and 1.0 x 0.6 mm footprint as CAN termination Q801. Gate uses existing R215 10k pull-up to 3V3; source to GND. TI specifies RDS(on) max 0.31 ohm at VGS=2.5 V (25 C), adequate for sub-mA LED current. ST HIGH/IN1 enables green; ST LOW/IN2 leaves blue only. No MCU control required."
